{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51159","headline":"陇西行（十首） 十 · 王勃","name":"陇西行（十首） 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少妇经年别，开帘知礼客。\n门户尔能持，归来笑投策。\n（以上同上五六五《巩昌府部》，又乾隆《直隶秦州新志》十一《艺文》於此《诗》）（乾隆《秦州新志》及乾隆《狄道州志》十三收外诗，连作一首。\n前书每二十字爲一行，或因此而析爲十首。）","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王勃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51159.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51159","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}